## Evidence classes

- `MEASURED` — estate number/state, rerunnable script
- `CITED` — published research, fetched + title-matched
- `DOCTRINE` — ratified design choice; build on it, but it is a choice, not a fact
- `OPEN` — not concluded

## Core doctrine (build to this)

- **Chunk first** — the atom (one topic/fact) is the unit; labelling/translation/rating are per-atom lenses, never whole-file ops
- **Lossless bronze, curated projection** — keep everything verbatim; curation is a rebuildable projection over bronze, never a trim of it
- **Provenance is positional** — folder = source, subfolder = day; capture writes no metadata
- **Consistency > accuracy** in labels — a consistent label is an address; correctness is earned only by calibration against gold
- **Deterministic-first labelling** — swarm proposes, fixed vocabulary normalises
- **Granularity is a SPEC** (proposition grain), not a model property — else each model drifts to its own prior (CITED)
- **Harden/synthesise split** — deterministic orchestrator gates sequence/state, never judges merit; model synthesises inside each gated stage
- **Test design is human, prior-art-grounded** — never authored by the AI it judges; judge = different model, position randomised (CITED)
- **Two value axes kept apart** — epistemic confidence (min-rule tier invariant) vs salience (0–5)
- **Gold is borrowed, not hand-authored** — calibrate against published corpora; Krippendorff's α ≥ 0.8 accept (≥ 0.667 tentative) (CITED)
- **Artefact ≠ conclusion** — raw thread is ground truth; generated synthesis is cross-checked against it, never overrides it

## The keystone chain

Small chunk ⇒ small labelling jump ⇒ accurate probabilistic choice ⇒ accurate blocks narrow
output spread ⇒ curate corpus to fit the weights (context-engineering over fine-tuning) ⇒
deterministic scaffold gates every seam (per-step accuracy multiplies — one ungated link rots
downstream) ⇒ retrieval lenses (vector/graph/relational) over one substrate; cross-lens
agreement = evidence, disagreement = gate flag ⇒ gates teach: bounce with counterexample,
model re-chooses, loop converges.

